WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Imagine remembering a word that was never spoken.
How does that happen?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers studied related word lists and
measured false recall under controlled conditions.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
This is an observation about memory, not evidence
that meditation products change it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A great explanation can feel familiar.
That still does not make marketing proven.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try your own free twelve-minute baseline,
then check the product's exact terms.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Follow the sources, ask what was measured,
and choose deliberately.
